{
  "bookId": "rewind-45",
  "id": "chapter-183",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37511001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "绿洲，娱乐区域——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "野猫",
          "text": "喵！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这又是哪里来的野猫啊？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "嘿嘿，看我用手雷吓跑它。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滴答，滴答，滴答……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……不，我可做不了堪比蛋壳雕花的电路操作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "那就是……剪蓝色的线！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "啊，可是蓝色的线也有两条啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511010",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "轰——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511011",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "1，1，【？】，7，17，41，99……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "选择最合适的数字牌进行填空……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "到底有完没完啊这个鬼地方！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "这个简单，我今天的幸运数字是……2！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "卦象是……「离为火」，选3！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "37511018",
              "text": "听哈莉的"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "37511018",
              "text": "听小乔的"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "37511018",
              "text": "我有自己的想法"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "37511017",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊熊雕像？",
          "text": "来得正好，来陪熊熊我玩问答游戏吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊熊雕像？",
          "text": "试问，如果有一个东西早上是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，不能忍了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "雷霆……只在一刹！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511023",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "嘿，那些门全都打开了耶。真是吃硬不吃软啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37511025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……我们继续前进。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-917",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "angelbeats",
          "rowIds": [
            37511001,
            37511002,
            37511003,
            37511004,
            37511005,
