          ],
          "sectionId": 37511
        }
      ],
      "title": "逆光的舞者·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37512001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "绿洲，生产区域——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "真是让我久等了呢，在我的领地里流窜的……小老鼠们~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "终于碰到守卫了……但是也只有一个人呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512004",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "真是怕什么来什么，此次回去一定要向掌柜的要双倍加班费……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "大家不可掉以轻心，她即是绿洲的现任管理人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "塞、塞西尔长官？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "「长官」？你们认识吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "咦，这不是哈莉吗？\n最近在梅根那过得不错啊，都换了一身非常可爱的校服了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "是的！长官！\n前特兰斯尓侦察局，第九小分队队长向您报道！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512010",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "面对原著世界的上级……她竟能站得这般笔直？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "汇报情况，为什么你和你的同伙会出现在这里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "报告长官，我近期因为无聊加入了一个新组织，来到此地进行人质营救任务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "呵，人质？真是个冷笑话，你知道这里是谁的地盘吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "现在知道了！长官！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "来，帮我想一个……合理的处理方案~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512016",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……！\n哈莉背在身后的手在打战术手语？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512017",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "「两人」……「前进」？这是在让我们先走？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512018",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……哈莉，你是想要独自拖住塞西尔吗？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "嘿嘿，长官真是太高看哈莉了。哈莉怎么可能想出什么方案呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512020",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "她准备「掩护」我们，手上在示意行动的倒计时……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512021",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "3……2……1！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512022",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "什么情况，我还没扔手雷呢？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "……哎呀，怎么偏偏炸开的是早上刚补好的洞口？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "小奏？\n不对，是她的「分身」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37512027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "百合……原来也在这里呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-918",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "angelbeats",
          "rowIds": [
            37512001,
            37512002,
