            37512009,
            37512010,
            37512011,
            37512012,
            37512013,
            37512014,
            37512015,
            37512016,
            37512017,
            37512018,
            37512019,
            37512020,
            37512021,
            37512022,
            37512023,
            37512024,
            37512025,
            37512026,
            37512027
          ],
          "sectionId": 37512
        }
      ],
      "title": "逆光的舞者·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37513001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啧，没想到在找到本体以前，分身先出现了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513002",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "本体……和分身？\n作案的是从她友人身上分化出来的不同个体。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "为什么要引发这么多的事件？这里已经不是「死后的世界」了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "百合，这是我们在「这个世界」的初次见面呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "正面回答我的问题，还有，别用小奏的语气和我说话！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "周围响起了密集的脚步声。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈？这些守卫是从哪里冒出来的？之前怎么一个都没看见？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "一眨眼，周围就全是奇怪的人了呢。放任这里有这么多隐藏通道真的好吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……这就是「特工只需要知道该知道的事」吗？加班费需要向掌柜的要三倍。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "原来如此……我们的行动被当成诱饵了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "清空了所有区域，设置奇怪的机关，提前埋伏了守卫……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "从一开始……绿洲就准备好应对红眼天使的袭击了吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "你很敏锐呢，小姑娘。有兴趣的话，以后不如来我手下做事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "刚才只是逗逗你们，因为我今天的日程早就被天使小姐预定好了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "……我们可以起舞了吗？小姐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513017",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "啪，绿洲的女王打了一个响指。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "全体开火。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "哒哒哒哒——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "喂，子弹全都被挡下来了啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……这是她的能力，可以偏转子弹的轨迹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "啊……真是美妙，不愧是与「战场」这座天堂相匹配的天使。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "……轮到我了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513024",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "铛！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37513025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "动作真快，差点头就掉下来了呢。接下来……就让我的电锯好好品尝吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "……呼，看来天使也并不是无坚不摧呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "偏转子弹、制造残影、驱使光剑，你到底还有多少神奇的能力？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "……长官将天使压制住了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "再加上周围守卫的支援……即使是天使，也「插翅难飞」了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "嗯？等……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "所有人捂上耳朵！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红眼天使",
          "text": "「防御技能·高频咆哮」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603008",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "糟糕……这次根本没有准备耳塞。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603010",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "光捂耳朵也……没有用！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "复数……天使……阻击……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "可恶……炸……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……声音……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603014",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "必须让那个分身停下！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603015",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这个距离……以现在的状态，用枪射不中……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "轰隆——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，恢复了？能听见了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "……重整态势！支援正在赶过来，剩下还能动的随我冲锋！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "这是……天使军团？哇塞，现在也刺激过头了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "呼……百合。\n刚才姑且将使用能力的那位击倒了，但是……出现了更多的分身。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这就是她们最棘手的地方了……分身也可以进行分身。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "必须要找到小奏……还有丢失的「Angel Player」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……这个交给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这是……对讲机？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "它能接通特殊的通讯频段。你带着它去找你的友人，应该会派上用场的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "你要留下来？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "这些分身未免太厉害了点，这的守卫可挡不住她们。在局势难以挽回前，只能再多花点力气了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "从刚见面起，我就知道你另有目的。朋友被关在这里什么的，也是谎话吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "啊……嗯，被识破了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "你是管理局的人，还是别的什么组织的？嘛，其实我全都无所谓。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "不，这显然是很应该关注的事吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "不知道，我只是看到面前站着一位我的同伴而已。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "在死后的世界，比你还要奇怪的同伴可是非常多呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "……百合。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "那么，就在庆功宴上见了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "记得请客哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37603037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "因为接下来……九天的雷霆，将只为你一人开道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-919",
