      "title": "逆光的舞者·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37515001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "两天前，绿洲深处——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "……如果你在绿洲内部期间，外面仍出现了红眼天使的事件。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "这就足够洗清你的嫌疑，即使是「高层」也没有理由插手了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我知道了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "这里是内外隔离的堡垒，即使她们来找你，危害也会局限在设施内。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "但……如果她们的能力超出了这里的承载上限，我需要一个备用方案。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……「Angel Player」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "那就是你们这些天在四处找的东西？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "嗯。通过它的程序，我可以将所有的分身吸收。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "我向你承诺，会有人跟进的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "……请放心，比起初来乍到的你们，她们更擅长处理……寻物委托。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515012",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "现在，绿洲外围——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "（吹口哨）绿洲在燃烧，旧日的威权在逐渐解体……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "天使的军团……和「天启」多般配啊？你说是吧——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "希塔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "塞拉，把「Angel Player」交出来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "哎，这明明是感人的再会，怎么一见面就又要我送礼物了？圣诞节可还没到哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "还有，什么是……「安格普雷亚」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不用装傻了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "攻入绿洲的天使们……她们所有的信号交换，都收束在你现在的位置。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "被发现了，诶嘿~☆",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "接下来，是玩游戏呢，还是不走程序直接打架？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "没时间陪你玩。波波！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515024",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "狂风呼啸——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "波雷亚斯",
          "text": "……响应汝的呼唤而来——吾乃钢翼的红岚，奈落的凶星，波雷亚斯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "好酷，你什么时候找了条巨龙做帮手？那个摩托小妹去哪了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "波雷亚斯",
          "text": "速速交出汝所盗取之宝物，否则，汝将坠入龙息炙烤之火狱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "「塞拉」，你是赢不了我们的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "形势比人强，我投降~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "想要就拿去吧。其实只要你求我，我当然会给你~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "在你开动小脑瓜思考我有什么阴谋诡计前，你先想想一个可能性——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37515033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
